{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2023-05", "window": 3, "start_date": 1684195200, "end_date": 1684886399, "month_true_total": 32, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:22:26 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "138724996", "author": {"steamid": "76561198042618457", "personaname": "Timotheistic", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Timotheism/", "num_games_owned": 1081, "num_reviews": 76, "playtime_forever": 107, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 107, "last_played": 1403348582, "avatar": "148ff422f2245ab66abfeabf3f7506861d6b703b"}, "language": "english", "review": "I don't typically like platformers, but this game is addictive and Risk of Rain 2 takes it once again to a new level of awesomeness!", "timestamp_created": 1684712048, "timestamp_updated": 1684712048, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "138717131", "author": {"steamid": "76561198029610672", "personaname": "Phantasmagoria", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198029610672/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 167, "playtime_forever": 312, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 278, "last_played": 1686101117, "avatar": "e8bdf24bc08bbbeab4313727cf26647f2b3325d0"}, "language": "english", "review": "There's an awful lot of time spent running around a pretty empty world, waiting for bullet sponge enemies to spawn so you can dodge through their attack and then go back to pressing your only good moves as soon as they're off cooldown. Not to mention keyboard ghosting being a pretty big issue here, as it often is with 2d roguelite games, but when you have so little in the way of meaningful actions with which to interact with the world and your enemies, it feels even worse here than it might in a game like Binding of Isaac.\n\nThe bones of what made RoR2 a great game (and a functional multiplayer one to boot!) are all very clearly present, but age has treated this particular roguelite like milk.", "timestamp_created": 1684702847, "timestamp_updated": 1684703050, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.492441862821578979", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "138656855", "author": {"steamid": "76561197996052593", "personaname": "Zeek", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/jag64/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 33, "playtime_forever": 179, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 179, "last_played": 1473734113, "avatar": "420b3a2110dff37749af13a7c02f454b0cdd594f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Remaster soon", "timestamp_created": 1684637125, "timestamp_updated": 1684637125, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52702707052230835", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 17, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "138646401", "author": {"steamid": "76561198067116327", "personaname": "Shindou", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ShinTheRobot/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 202, "playtime_forever": 3209, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3209, "last_played": 1595616154, "avatar": "7fa1c3a9ae5c5034fe846536e38ba6f0144c5326"}, "language": "english", "review": "Jerma985 is a Liar.", "timestamp_created": 1684622394, "timestamp_updated": 1684622394, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 11, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.598945975303649902", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "138525309", "author": {"steamid": "76561198030953052", "personaname": "Imjusthereformemes", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198030953052/", "num_games_owned": 596, "num_reviews": 122, "playtime_forever": 2051, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2043, "last_played": 1739587895, "avatar": "f57d288b44c00fd50cda810ff4d0435e2c75e59f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Risk of Rain is one of the few roguelikes that I am actually a fan of. Usually an endless game where you die a lot and lose all of your cool stuff is not something I enjoy, but this one has a lot going for it. For one, it's procedurally generated levels feel like Metroid and the characters all feel like rival bounty hunters to Samus. Characters are also very unique in terms of gameplay, making it a ton of fun to unlock them all and try them out. And there is an end-game instead of being a forever war to see how long you last, which is usually my biggest complaint about games like this. And finally, while the game is ♥♥♥♥♥♥ [i] hard [/i], it does feel fair. Obviously the right buffs will make you an OP monster, but you can still get by sheer willpower and skill if it comes to it. It's pretty impressive that the game feels well balanced for almost all of the wildly diverse playstyles. Also the soundtrack slaps. Good job Hopoo Games!", "timestamp_created": 1684468689, "timestamp_updated": 1702279907, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}]}